Z||000017||BlackStang95||10-09-2001||02:46 AM||||Ugh.<P>You didnt shoot down any of my points, I reproved them and shot down all of yours.  What we have here, is a case of a guy who loves his car blindly and stuipidly and refuses to admit there are other nice cars out there.  I can get subframe connectors for $100, oooh big loss, lol.  I've seen videos of stock GT's running 13.9's...maybe it was with reaction time deleted but oh well. My intelligence is low? Why..because I know facts and I know what I've done and what my car can do? Idiot.  This is a classic case of an idiot know-it-all that thinks his car is the greatest thing to ever touch the road.  I know real things about real cars, I'm gonna graduate in 2002 with a bachelors degree in Automotive Technology. So when you bring your fiero in for an oil change (I've seen first hand how difficult they are for an average joe), look around the employee parking lot, if you see a black v6 mustang feel free to bring it.    ***** .||||reg||1
