Z||000026||Spektrum-87GT||10-09-2001||05:31 PM||||ok, ok, enough.<P>95 stock mustang gt    0-60  6.7 from road and track<P>87 fiero gt   0-60 8.0 from road and track<P>no way a stock fiero gt could beat a stock mustang gt.<P>BOTH are decent cars in stock form, but BOTH are slow, enough said, when you get into how fast they are after engine swaps... well its all in how much you want to spend. blackstang95 never said his car was fast, he actually called it slow. I'm calling my fiero gt slow, because it is and the number prove it. BOTH cars are fun to drive and I think thats all that matters. When it comes to comparing them, they ARE apples and oranges... but both of them are fruits right? he also never said a bad thing about the fiero, so whats the big deal? now blackstang95, feel free to post in here because you like fieros if its fiero related... but please no more stories about your mustang in a fiero forum, ok? :-P<p>[This message has been edited by Spektrum-87GT (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||1
