Z||000044||Slammed Fiero||10-10-2001||10:18 AM||||View from a 5.0ltr.(On a track)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/corner1.jpg"> <P>Hmmm... Where's your all mighty 5.0ltr now? and that is a 5.0ltr by the way , a 5spd.<P>The exit speed on that corner is about 80mph. Do you think the 5.0 took it at that speed? with it's solid axle? me either... This is with my old suspension setup. Mustangs have wet dreams about being able to corner that flat.<P>End of story..<P>PS. GC...didn't know I had a fan club! I have that article too.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycar_1.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals, Big Bore TB, 70Hp Shot of NOS Autocrossed , Tracked , Dragged? (soon) abused.||||reg||1
Z||000045||firstfiero||10-10-2001||10:22 AM||||        Typical Mustang fan. They all think their cars are unbeatable gods when the truth is their the slowest cheapest junk of their class of cars. And this is coming from a ford guy. Mustangs drive like a damn Ford Tauras .....Test drove one last month. I dislike gm but you can't even compare a cobra mustang to a camaro ss or the trans-am.<BR>         What's really funny is the mustang R. Cost is like 55k For a Mustang! And it's still not as fast as a corvette which is 10k cheaper. Then lets add the fact that their is no heat, ac or Radio And according to car magazines is horrible to drive unless your on a race track. Not only is the Corvette faster and handles better for cheaper but is a smooth daily driver. I believe they only made 250 of them? The reason for that is You'll have a hard time even getting the dumbest Stang driver to wanna pay that much for one. <BR>     The Mustang was so horrible and dissapointing that I test drove. I ended up waiting and getting a Ford sport trac. If I want a sporting ride I'll drive my fiero.<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
